{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211420","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121142001:1":{"text":"호건 장군님, 저희 왔어요!","source_cn":"霍根将军，我们来赴约啦！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A13E827C8A08433","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"호건 장군님, 저희 왔어요!","female":"호건 장군님, 저희 왔어요!","variant_male_record_index":"99512","variant_female_record_index":"99513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121142002:1":{"text":"왔는가! 조세린에게 준비를 부탁했다네. 드디어 자네들에게 한 상 거하게 저녁을 대접할 기회가 왔군.","source_cn":"欢迎！我已经让乔思琳准备好了，终于有一次，能请你们坐在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26803FE23CED87E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121142003:0":{"text":"밥 먹자고 할 때마다 항상 돌발사건이 벌어졌잖아요. 이건 그냥 저주 같은 거죠.","source_cn":"之前每次说要吃饭，你们都被突发事件拉走，简直像是诅咒一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C1BEC80948A672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121142004:1":{"text":"휴...! 드디어 장군님께서 한턱내시네요! 제가 이날을 얼마나 오랫동안 기다렸던지... 크흠, 여러분을 너무 오래 기다리게 한 건 아닌지 모르겠네요.","source_cn":"终于可以让将军请客了！我等这天已经好久——咳，希望这顿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB13E0B4A3D661D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1121142004":{"text":"휴...! 드디어 장군님께서 한턱내시네요! 제가 이날을 얼마나 오랫동안 기다렸던지... 크흠, 여러분을 너무 오래 기다리게 한 건 아닌지 모르겠네요.","source_cn":"终于可以让将军请客了！我等这天已经好久——咳，希望这顿饭没让你们久等，不然骑士团就太过意不去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB13E0B4A3D661D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121142005:3":{"text":"아직 안 왔어요.","source_cn":"嗯？她还没来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6878EFF37D29B81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121142006:1":{"text":"조금만 더 기다리지. 반신님을 홀대할 수는 없는 것 아닌가.","source_cn":"再等等，不能怠慢了半神殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73C6194D9E55BC56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1121142007:1":{"text":"잠시 뒤...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C4429B007DA7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121142008:1":{"text":"여러분, 안녕하십니까?","source_cn":"诸位近来安好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A16292E5D5EE1A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121142009:0":{"text":"브라이언입니다. 상의드릴 일이...","source_cn":"久未传讯，在下布莱恩。有一事相商……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA7D5F361E5BB1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_tit